      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "寒露是农历九月的\"节\"。气温明显下降，霜冻将近。",
        "en": "Hanlu is the node term of the ninth lunar month. Temperatures drop noticeably; frost approaches."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（传统历法编算规则）"
      ],
      "period": "现行农历编算口径；GB/T 33661-2017 为现行国家标准（正文条款待人工核读）",
